      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that queries recent data points for a named metric over a time window using a concrete external provider. I will use AWS CloudWatch as the external provider since it is a widely used service for monitoring and logging. The script will use the Boto3 library to interact with AWS CloudWatch. </thinking>\n",
